    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1004.2086v1</id>
    <title>Lieb-Robinson Bounds in Quantum Many-Body Physics</title>
    <updated>2010-04-13T01:02:54Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1004.2086v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1004.2086v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We give an overview of recent results on Lieb-Robinson bounds and some of their applications in the study of quantum many-body models in condensed matter physics.</summary>
